{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>EASY 是一款運用裝置端 AI 自動整理相簿的相片工具，能辨識寵物、食物、風景、人物、文件等內容，並按城市與日期建立智能相簿，適合希望節省整理時間及重視私隱的 iPhone 用戶。原價 US $0.99，現時<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-158.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>離線智能相簿整理</h2>\n<p>EASY 運用 Apple Vision 在裝置上辨識相片內容，自動把寵物、食物、風景、人物及文件等分類成智能相簿，並可按城市、內容類型與日期範圍建立自動更新的自訂相簿。所有 AI 均在 iPhone 本機處理，毋須網絡連線，亦不設帳戶、追蹤或資料收集，相片不會離開裝置。內置編輯器亦提供裁剪、旋轉與調整工具，方便直接整理影像。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-389-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-390-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-391-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-392-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-393-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-394-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：EASY – AI Photo Organizer</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/easy-ai-photo-organizer/id1390326774?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:13.350350+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":348,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T03:39:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:38.822201+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:38.822201+00:00","content_hash":"4fdd5fe7d8b4b3be7aa92f73ecf679aedc427c4e99aa92fa30cd0b5e1b9c929d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}